-capture/14069722/assets/3e4fb2143266d45a620bf39a978ba8ac4f0ed2585942f79dc90435a4896f9a0d.png)\n\nBy symmetry, this equals the area corresponding to the probability $P(Z>0.73).$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14069722/assets/6bb24449a20276b9d190e2b31926bb6e0d52f22536431e27c05db00b92886ffc.png)\n\nNote that the two shaded areas above have the same area. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(Z<-0.73) & =P(Z>0.73) \\\\  & =1-P(Z<0.73) \\\\  & =1-Φ(0.73) \\\\  & =1-0.7673 \\\\  & =0.2327.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365298 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365299 13194139535768 true] [17592186365298 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365300 13194139535768 true] [17592186365298 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365301 13194139535768 true] [17592186365298 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365302 13194139535768 true] [17592186365298 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365303 13194139535768 true] [17592186365298 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535768 true] [17592186365298 1041 "selection" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365298 1104 #edb/ref 17592186365300 13194139535768 true] [17592186365298 1110 #uuid "b2f5c906-45d7-5753-ba38-7ae8cd989afa" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365299 1034 "0.2136" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365299 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535768 true] [17592186365299 1111 #uuid "67b9bc74-9eea-5963-a2d1-dc5e233fb4b6" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365300 1034 "0.2327" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365300 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535768 true] [17592186365300 1111 #uuid "32d799bf-a468-5ff8-b025-f5a1b7324f6b" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365301 1034 "0.2470" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365301 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535768 true] [17592186365301 1111 #uuid "66a9b14a-2b51-5958-90b9-5563fbd4da08" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365302 1034 "0.7849" 13194139535768 true] [17592186365302 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535768 true] [17592186365302 1111 #uuid "f02e57b8-707b-5043-ab46-84ce68daf9c9" 13194139535768 true] [1